  "solution": "The correct answer is option 1) –,÷,+,×, = \n\nSOLUTION:\n\n The given equation is:\n\n 57 * 35 * 7 * 14 * 2 * 80\n\nLet's apply each option and solve the equation using BODMAS rule: Bracket of Division Multiplication Addition Subtraction.\n\n Option 1) –,÷,+,×, = \n\n57 - **35 ÷ **7 + 14 × 2 = 80\n\n57 - 5 + **14 ****×**** 2** = 80\n\n**57** - 5 **+**** 28** = 80\n\n**85 -**** 5** = 80\n\n80 = 80 **C**orrect \n\n Option 2) ×, +, ÷,–, =\n\n57 × 35 + **7 ÷ 14** - 2 = 80\n\n**57 ****×**** 35** + 0.5 - 2 = 80\n\n**1995 + 0.5** - 2 = 80\n\n**1995.5 - 2** = 80\n\n1993.5 = 80 Incorrect \n\n Option 3) +,–, ×,÷, =\n\n57 + 35 - 7 × **14 ÷ 2** = 80\n\n57 + 35 - **7 ****×**** 7** = 80\n\n**57 +**** 35** - 49 = 80\n\n**92 - 49** = 80\n\n43 = 80 Incorrect \n\n Option 4) +, –, ÷,×, =\n\n57 + 35 - **7 ****÷ 14** × 2 = 80\n\n57 + 35 - **0.5**** × 2 **= 80\n\n**57 +**** 35** - 1 = 80\n\n**92 - 1** = 80\n\n91 = 80 Incorrect \n\nHence, the correct answer is ** \"–,÷,+,×, =\".**",
